# Audit exclusions for `tama find-violations`: paths fixed by something
# outside this project.
#
# The repository root is the site root. Vercel serves every file here at its
# own path, so the path IS the public address: index.html is the home page,
# robots.txt and sitemap.xml are well-known URLs crawlers fetch by name,
# favicon.svg is the icon, styles.css is the stylesheet seventy pages link,
# and script.js the script they load. vercel.json, .gitignore and
# .wisent-release.json are read by their tools at exactly this path, and
# VERSION is the version source .wisent-release.json names. Moving any of
# them renames a public address or breaks a tool.
.
